    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the \"small moments\" feel so fake when you realize they don't actually change anything. like, if the universe is just going to end and everything we are is just atoms drifting in a void, why bother trying to make those moments matter? it feels like just delaying the inevitable. it feels more logical to just accept that it's all meaningless and stop fighting it.",
