      "content": "I hear you—when the big picture feels like a blank wall, even the bright spots can seem like tricks you're playing on yourself. But \"meaningless\" and \"not worth experiencing\" aren't the same thing: a song can be beautiful even if it ends, and a laugh still feels real in your chest, regardless of the void. You don't have to fight the void; you can just let it sit beside you while you breathe. If stopping the fight means resting, that's okay—you don't have to perform meaning today, just exist.",
